msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"You know that car parked in front of Millennium Tower? I think it belongs to"
" Defense Minister Tamiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Really? What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I saw it on the news. Tamiya was riding in the same exact car, surrounded by"
" reporters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Just because it's the same make and model doesn't mean it's Tamiya's..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Well, maybe you'd be up to date if you actually watched the news instead of "
"just reading the paper all the time!"
msgstr ""

